{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>訪談節目《九運會客室2》自10月中開播以來爭議不斷，男主持李凱賢Brian在第13集訪問資深女星夏文汐時因事前毫無準備而引發討論。面對主持對自己參演過經典作品及熱播劇集一無所知，向來優雅從容夏文汐當場直斥對方表現不合格。</p>\n<h2>夏文汐受訪遭主持Brian零準備對待</h2>\n<p>節目邀請到80年代性感女神夏文汐擔任嘉賓，她在席間大方分享昔日與周潤發及張國榮等巨星合作經歷。身為主持之一李凱賢卻在鏡頭前坦言，在眾多影視作品中僅看過對方參演過電影《寒戰1994》，對其餘代表作近乎一無所知。面對主持事前零功課態度，一向好脾氣夏文汐亦難掩無奈，當場指出他準備不足及直斥「唔掂」。她更忍不住開口勸導對方：「咁失敗㗎！呢套你又冇聽過，冇睇過？咁你要睇返。」</p>\n<h2>Brian狂爆粗 被指嚴重破壞訪談節奏</h2>\n<p>Brian在鏡頭前不時露出誇張表情，全程猶如「坐觀眾席」般只懂搭嘴「That’s fucking right!」、「Amazing!」、「Wow it’s crazy」等簡單英文及粗口，被指嚴重破壞訪談節奏。有眼利網民更留言指出，夏文汐在席間似乎刻意避開與Brian交談，對其粗俗言行有所保留。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179453974157176221_4842705376af680dde4927.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6319028075592619678.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179453974157176221_4842705376af680dde4927.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Brian狂爆粗 被指嚴重破壞訪談節奏（圖片來源：youtube@HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179453974298753273_14130521366af680df5e1de.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6319028075592619672.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179453974298753273_14130521366af680df5e1de.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>一向好脾氣夏文汐亦難掩無奈，當場指出他準備不足及直斥「唔掂」。（圖片來源：youtube@HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179453974440159992_18698383226af680e0efa80.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6319028075592619675.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179453974440159992_18698383226af680e0efa80.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>全程猶如「坐觀眾席」般只懂搭嘴「That’s fucking right!」、「Amazing!」、「Wow it’s crazy」等簡單英文及粗口（圖片來源：youtube@HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>伍詠薇獨力撐大局 夏文汐優雅狀態成強烈對比</h2>\n<p>節目播出後，兩位主持與嘉賓的表現成為網民熱議焦點。不少觀眾大讚年屆六旬的夏文汐保養得宜、舉止優雅大方，面對後輩的無知仍保持風度，狀態大勇；而拍檔伍詠薇亦盛裝打扮以示尊重，憑藉豐富的主持經驗與夏文汐對答如流，被讚「憑一人之力撐起整個節目」。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179453974618766913_2837335636af680e2ad4ac.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6319028075592619676.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179453974618766913_2837335636af680e2ad4ac.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>夏文汐優雅狀態（圖片來源：youtube@HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17945397479722622_18512014486af680e46a9d3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6319028075592619673.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17945397479722622_18512014486af680e46a9d3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：youtube@HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>網民洗版促製作組換走男主持</h2>\n<p>隨著這集未經刪剪原片在YouTube直出，社交平台Threads及YouTube隨即湧現大量負評，大批網民一面倒批評男主持市井及無做功課。有網民發文質疑電視台會否聽取民意將他撤換，留言直指他「為爆粗而爆粗，拉低成個節目格調」，更有人直言「伍姑娘完全一個人做都可以，直接剪走男主持」。雖然有少數人表示喜歡他講粗口夠搞笑，但主流意見仍促請製作團隊正視觀眾訴求。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179453974997156802_17606328336af680e666589.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6319028075592619666.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179453974997156802_17606328336af680e666589.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17945397530766706_7152759586af680e983c30.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6319028075592619669.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17945397530766706_7152759586af680e983c30.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179453975417082371_8235845316af680eaa7e80.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6319028075592619667 (1).png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179453975417082371_8235845316af680eaa7e80.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：c）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T03:35:00.937882+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1299,"images":8,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T03:16:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T04:29:16.745791+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T03:28:33.314241+00:00","content_hash":"c3d9574e0d6eab8c33a7f3961fb2566688acea1d3a841dcdb3e563400532ac4c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}